(7755569, 1283080, 83313, '<td valign="top">Negative pointage for making me put on 5 pounds looking at this.</td>', 'Negative pointage for making me put on 5 pounds looking at this.', '2023-08-02 21:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755570, 1282391, 30982, '<td valign="top">Far and away the best of the challenge.  Thank you!</td>', 'Far and away the best of the challenge.  Thank you!', '2023-08-02 21:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755580, 1282964, 10686, '<td valign="top">The backside is almost always the least interesting side of a person. Who a person really is is in their face. Pics like this, especially of people in groups outside the mainstream always strike me as sort of predatory, like you''re sneaking a picture of them instead of talking to them like people. Maybe I''m wrong about the reality of the circumstances, but that''s the impression I get.</td>', 'The backside is almost always the least interesting side of a person. Who a person really is is in their face. Pics like this, especially of people in groups outside the mainstream always strike me as sort of predatory, like you''re sneaking a picture of them instead of talking to them like people. Maybe I''m wrong about the reality of the circumstances, but that''s the impression I get.', '2023-08-03 03:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755581, 1283080, 10686, '<td valign="top">On the plus side, this morsel looks really tasty and the exposure is right on. <br/> <br/>This really needs some food styling. The rough texture of the white filling and the nuts stuck to it on the right side are distracting as are the two chocolate shavings with the OOF bits of nut behind it that look like they fell off. If you want to present it on chocolate shavings put down a whole plate of them. Personally, I''d have shot it wider, on a nice plate presented like you would for a recipe book and used a more diffuse light. I don''t mean to harp on you too much, food photography is HARD to do well and this really is a solid try.</td>', 'On the plus side, this morsel looks really tasty and the exposure is right on.  This really needs some food styling. The rough texture of the white filling and the nuts stuck to it on the right side are distracting as are the two chocolate shavings with the OOF bits of nut behind it that look like they fell off. If you want to present it on chocolate shavings put down a whole plate of them. Personally, I''d have shot it wider, on a nice plate presented like you would for a recipe book and used a more diffuse light. I don''t mean to harp on you too much, food photography is HARD to do well and this really is a solid try.', '2023-08-03 03:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755582, 1283069, 10686, '<td valign="top">I used to live just down the coast back in See Canyon near Avila Beach. Nice</td>', 'I used to live just down the coast back in See Canyon near Avila Beach. Nice', '2023-08-03 03:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755583, 1282971, 10686, '<td valign="top">This image gives me vertigo. Well done</td>', 'This image gives me vertigo. Well done', '2023-08-03 03:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755584, 1282809, 10686, '<td valign="top">I wish that dark spot in the middle of the sky wasn''t there. Still solid.</td>', 'I wish that dark spot in the middle of the sky wasn''t there. Still solid.', '2023-08-03 03:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755585, 1283042, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the dynamic balance and layers going on here</td>', 'I like the dynamic balance and layers going on here', '2023-08-03 03:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755587, 1282968, 10686, '<td valign="top">Such a great expression and the repeating shapes of the figures and the bottles. You really caught the moment. <br/> <br/>Did you try cropping off the right side to a square? For me, that tightens it up gets rid of that distracting post strengthens the fore/aft layer of the bottles and the people and creates a Left/Right symmetry between the two figures that''s broken by the guy on the right''s great expression. A solid 8</td>', 'Such a great expression and the repeating shapes of the figures and the bottles. You really caught the moment.  Did you try cropping off the right side to a square? For me, that tightens it up gets rid of that distracting post strengthens the fore/aft layer of the bottles and the people and creates a Left/Right symmetry between the two figures that''s broken by the guy on the right''s great expression. A solid 8', '2023-08-03 03:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755588, 1283066, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great scene, I might crop the left but still excellent</td>', 'Great scene, I might crop the left but still excellent', '2023-08-03 03:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755589, 1282391, 10686, '<td valign="top">OMG, this is great, straight up 10</td>', 'OMG, this is great, straight up 10', '2023-08-03 03:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755590, 1282963, 10686, '<td valign="top">The yellow is so bright it makes me angry. Good job</td>', 'The yellow is so bright it makes me angry. Good job', '2023-08-03 03:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755602, 1282931, 61234, '<td valign="top">Fantastic on SOOO many levels! Nothing short of 10!</td>', 'Fantastic on SOOO many levels! Nothing short of 10!', '2023-08-03 12:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755675, 1282391, 53814, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2023-08-04 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755676, 1282931, 53814, '<td valign="top">Everyone is in their place. Great job!</td>', 'Everyone is in their place. Great job!', '2023-08-04 12:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755677, 1283097, 53814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2023-08-04 12:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755715, 1283042, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''ve already given you a 10. Coming back to this, I find myself seriously bothered by the white-sky eye trap in the upper left corner. So much so I''m coming down to a 9. It works perfectly for me if it''s cropped down to exclude that bit. Wonderful image! The echoing rectangular forms are very powerful, as is the bottom diagonal, all of that framing the wonderful dog and his groomer.</td>', 'I''ve already given you a 10. Coming back to this, I find myself seriously bothered by the white-sky eye trap in the upper left corner. So much so I''m coming down to a 9. It works perfectly for me if it''s cropped down to exclude that bit. Wonderful image! The echoing rectangular forms are very powerful, as is the bottom diagonal, all of that framing the wonderful dog and his groomer.', '2023-08-04 16:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755737, 1283095, 30049, '<td valign="top">Don''t know where this is, but it''s pretty awesome!  Love the light and shadows.  The kid is a great touch (two adults wouldn''t have the same impact).  Hope you share where this is in your notes.</td>', 'Don''t know where this is, but it''s pretty awesome!  Love the light and shadows.  The kid is a great touch (two adults wouldn''t have the same impact).  Hope you share where this is in your notes.', '2023-08-04 23:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755738, 1283041, 30049, '<td valign="top">Those clouds look surreal!  I know you wanted to capture the entire view, and the foreground does add a layering effect, but I can''t help wondering what was available from a slightly different perspective?  That body of water, building, mountains, and broody sky could stand alone without this foreground.  Just saying.  :-)</td>', 'Those clouds look surreal!  I know you wanted to capture the entire view, and the foreground does add a layering effect, but I can''t help wondering what was available from a slightly different perspective?  That body of water, building, mountains, and broody sky could stand alone without this foreground.  Just saying.  :-)', '2023-08-04 23:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755739, 1282464, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of IR.  Sorry.</td>', 'Not a big fan of IR.  Sorry.', '2023-08-04 23:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755740, 1283069, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting how compressed this view looks.  Telephoto lens?  Neat impact.</td>', 'Interesting how compressed this view looks.  Telephoto lens?  Neat impact.', '2023-08-04 23:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755741, 1282391, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like it (the B&amp;W tones especially), just wish there was some part of it in focus.</td>', 'I like it (the B&W tones especially), just wish there was some part of it in focus.', '2023-08-04 23:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755742, 1283073, 30049, '<td valign="top">This would have been so awesome to see!  I think the comp could have benefited by less centering of the subject, and either crop the top or straighten the horizon.</td>', 'This would have been so awesome to see!  I think the comp could have benefited by less centering of the subject, and either crop the top or straighten the horizon.', '2023-08-04 23:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
